# Notes against your acceptance criteria

This implementation satisfies the requested parts:

## Bucket
- versioning enabled
- server-side encryption enabled
- public access blocked
- optional prod replication support

## RDS
- deletion protection enabled
- backup retention set to 7 days or more
- publicly accessible = false

## IAM
- IRSA/OIDC trust for service accounts
- policy passed in as JSON so prod can remain least-privilege
- no wildcard actions required in prod

